    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 6104 recorded a gross prior-year reserve release of $18.505m (favourable), representing approximately a 10.3% reduction versus opening gross claims outstanding (prior-year opening $180.325m). The release was driven by favourable prior-year development on catastrophe claims, specifically prior typhoon and California wildfire exposures (Typhoons Faxai, Hagibis, Jebi and California wildfires), improving the closed-year outcome and contributing to a calendar-year profit of $18.8m. The Syndicate writes reinsurance (primarily property catastrophe quota-share), and the prior-year release principally affected the reinsurance-property portfolio.",
